摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Use your OpenAI subscription with DeepSeek Harness to access GPT models, image generation, and web search.","id":"gh:1335029930","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-codex-oauth","slug":"WNJXYK/dsh-codex-oauth","topics":["codex","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","deepseek-harness-plugins","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-verify","dsh-plugins","oauth","openai"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Use your OpenAI subscription with DeepSeek Harness to access GPT models, image generation, and web s"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ur OpenAI subscription with DeepSeek Harness to access GPT models, image generation, and web search."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🔐 DSH-Codex-OAuth"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **🎯 What it does:** Sign in with a ChatGPT / Codex subscription to enjoy powerful GPT models, imag"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e generation, and web search in DeepSeek Harness, with subscription quota reporting included."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **🧩 Compatibility:** Verified on DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`; future releases will continue to be tested agai"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nst the latest DSH version."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **⚠️ Risk:** This project is built on open-source software and relies on non-public ChatGPT Codex "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"backend endpoints. OpenAI protocol changes may temporarily break features until the plugin is update"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"d, and there may also be a low risk of account suspension."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ✨ Plugin highlights"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **🚀 Direct subscription access** — GPT models, image generation, and web search share your OpenAI "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"subscription quota.\n- **🧩 Controlled integration** — the model picker, generated images, and web sea"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"rch integrate into DeepSeek Harness with dedicated controls.\n- **🔐 Multiple sign-in methods** — supp"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"orts browser sign-in and headless device-code authorization.\n- **🌗 UI adaptation** — follows DSH's E"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"nglish/Chinese language and Light, Dark, or System theme."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 📦 Install / Upgrade"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🟢 npm"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🐙 GitHub"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 🗑️ Uninstall"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"npm and GitHub installations use the same removal command:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 🧰 Plugin capabilities"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| 🤖 GPT models | Activates DSH's built-in `openai-codex` provider and dynamically loads models avail"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"able to the account. |\n| 🎨 Image generation | Registers the `generate_image` tool, supports multiple"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" image sizes and quality levels, and displays the generated result. |\n| 🌐 Web search | Routes native"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" `web_search` through hosted GPT search and returns answer text with structured source URLs. |\n| 📊 S"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ubscription usage | Shows plan, remaining quota, reset times, and windows such as 5-hour and weekly "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"limits. |\n| 🔑 OAuth | Supports browser sign-in, device codes, automatic token renewal, status refres"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"h, and sign-out. |\n| 🖥️ Native integration | Provides model and feature controls, image previews, bi"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"lingual copy, and theme adaptation while following DSH's hot-plug design. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🖼️ Feature preview"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Account status and model settings | Headless sign-in | Image generation | Web search (X/Twitter) |"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## ⚙️ Detailed configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"No configuration is normally required. Available options are:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Option | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `dshHome` | DSH Home | Custom DSH home directory used to resolve default file paths. |\n| `path` | "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"`$DSH_HOME/codex-oauth.json` | Host-side OAuth credential file. |\n| `preferencesPath` | `$DSH_HOME/c"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"odex-oauth-preferences.json` | Model visibility and feature switches; defaults beside `path` when it"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" is overridden. |\n| `issuer` | `https://auth.openai.com` | OAuth issuer; override only for gateways "},{"id":"p25s5","text":"or tests. |\n| `usageUrl` | `https://chatgpt.com/backend-api/wham/usage` | Subscription usage endpoin"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"t. |\n| `controlPort` | `1456` | Loopback login, status, and preference service. |\n| `redirectPort` |"},{"id":"p25s7","text":" `1455` | Loopback browser OAuth callback. |\n| Search `model` | `gpt-5.6-sol` | Model used by hosted"},{"id":"p25s8","text":" web search, aligned with the default Codex Power configuration. |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Example Cordis configuration:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Web search and image-generation orchestration both default to the Codex Power model `gpt-5.6-sol`; i"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"mages are rendered by the hosted GPT Image (`image_generation`) tool; chat models are discovered dyn"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"amically from the `openai-codex` model provider supplied by DSH's built-in `llm-pi-ai` plugin."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"This project is available under the MIT License, authored by WNJXYK."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
